1
00:00:05,164 --> 00:00:08,294
(Sheldon:)They took our TV, two laptops,
four external hard drives...

2
00:00:08,458 --> 00:00:12,708
(Sheldon:)...our PS2, our PS3, our Xbox,
our Xbox 360, our classic Nintendo...

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:17,180
(Sheldon:)...our Super Nintendo,
our Nintendo 64, and our Wii.

4
00:00:17,342 --> 00:00:19,222
(Leonard:)We like games.

5
00:00:19,386 --> 00:00:23,596
Right, games. They took "Halo 1," "Halo 2,"
"Halo 3," "Call of Duty 1," "Call of Duty 2"...

6
00:00:23,765 --> 00:00:25,765
..."Call of Duty 3," "Rock Band"...

7
00:00:25,934 --> 00:00:29,474
..."Final Fantasy I" through "IX,"
"The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time"...

8
00:00:29,646 --> 00:00:33,276
..."The Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess,"
"Super Mario Bros."...

9
00:00:33,442 --> 00:00:36,282
..."Mario & Sonic
at the Winter Olympics"...

10
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:40,200
...and "Ms. Pac-Man."

11
00:00:42,409 --> 00:00:44,869
(Policeman:)Assorted video games.

12
00:00:45,454 --> 00:00:47,664
(Sheldon:)When does the CSI team get here?

13
00:00:48,999 --> 00:00:51,749
(Leonard:)-What?
-In anticipation of their arrival...

14
00:00:51,919 --> 00:00:53,709
(Sheldon:)...I've bagged some evidence.

15
00:00:53,879 --> 00:00:56,719
(Sheldon:)One of the thieves had the audacity
to quench his thirst...

16
00:00:56,882 --> 00:01:00,382
(Sheldon:)...while ransacking our home.
You should be able to pull prints off this.

17
00:01:00,552 --> 00:01:04,642
(Sheldon:)Here are my prints
so you can rule me out as a suspect.

